<title>USA: Maxim Group to buy Bailey &amp; Roberts.</title>
<headline>Maxim Group to buy Bailey &amp; Roberts.</headline>
<dateline>KENNESAW, Ga. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Maxim Group Inc said on Thursday it has signed a non-binding letter of intent to acquire Bailey &amp; Roberts Flooring Inc.</p>
<p>Bailey &amp; Roberts generates annual sales of approximately $14 million. Financial terms of the tentative deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The transaction is expected to close within 60 days, Maxim said.</p>
</text>
